    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Michael Gilmartin are delighted to present No. 3 Coill Fuinseoige to the market. This attractive detached home is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, families, those looking to downsize, and those requiring ground floor bedroom and bathroom accommodation.\n\nSituated in a low-density development of just 32 homes, the property enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within easy walking distance of Nenagh town centre and its excellent range of amenities.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and includes 3 ground floor bedrooms (one could easily be used as a study/office/2nd TV room) and a fully tiled shower room, making it ideal for those seeking flexible or future-proof living. Upstairs, there are two further spacious double bedrooms and a fully tiled family bathroom.\n\nThe welcoming living room features a solid fuel stove and double doors opening into the bright kitchen/dining room. A sliding patio door from the dining area leads directly to the rear patio and private garden, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nBeautifully positioned within the development, No. 3 enjoys maximum privacy and a tranquil setting.\n\nFor anyone seeking a detached home within walking distance of Nenagh town centre, this is a property that must be viewed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.628w x 3.288d\nTimber floor\n\nLiving Room - 3.281w x 4.054d\nTimber floor, solid fuel stove, double doors to Kitchen/Dining room.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 5.325w x 3.558d\nWhite fitted units, integrated hob, oven, fridge and dishwasher. Island unit. Double doors to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.966w x 1.845d\nPlumbed for washing machine, rear access door\n\nGround Floor Bedroom 1 to Front - 2.862w x 2.164d\nTimber floor\n\nGround Floor Bedroom 2 to Front - 2.967w x 2.859d\nTimber floor\n\nGround Floor Bathroom - 1.720w x 1.683d\nFully tiled, wc, whb, electric shower, heated hand towel rail.\n\nGround Floor Bedroom to Rear - 2.977w x 3.582d\nTimber floor,BIW\n\nFirst Floor Bedroom 1 - 2.996w x 3.480d\nCarpet flooring, dormer window\n\nFirst Floor Bathroom - 1.805wx 1.720d\nElectric Shower, modernly tiled, heated hand towel rail.\n\nWalk in Hot Press - 1.856w x 0.780d\n\n\nFirst floor Bedroom 2 - 3.272w x 3.527d\nCarpet floor and built in sliderobes\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Highly desirable location in a low density development.</li><li> Private and secluded site.</li><li> Well maintained internally and externally.</li><li> Walking distance to town centre.</li><li> Gardens front and rear.</ul>"
